names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Noh</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Shin</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Choi</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Min</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recurrence following curative resection for gastric carcinoma</article-title><source>Br J Surg</source><year>2000</year><volume>87</volume><fpage>236</fpage><lpage>242</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Surg||87|236||bib26|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10671934</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>